title: Linux ptrace Process Injection
id: f8f0bfbb-4092-4420-a591-e68976a48595
status: experimental
description: Detects use of ptrace-based injection tooling on Linux (gdb attach with inject, or processes attaching to and writing another process's memory via PTRACE_POKETEXT), used to inject code into running processes.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1055/008/
logsource:
  product: linux
  category: process_creation
detection:
  selection:
    CommandLine|contains:
      - 'PTRACE_POKETEXT'
      - 'gdb -p'
      - 'ptrace('
      - 'inject.so'
  condition: selection
  condition: selection
fields:
  - CommandLine
  - User
falsepositives:
  - Debugging with gdb
level: high
tags:
  - attack.privilege_escalation
  - attack.t1055.008
